  "body": "## What type of PR is this?\n\n- [ ] API-change\n- [ ] BUG\n- [x] Improvement\n- [ ] Documentation\n- [x] Feature\n- [x] Test and CI\n- [ ] Code Refactoring\n\n## Which issue(s) this PR fixes:\n\nissue #23913\n\n## What this PR does / why we need it:\n\nThis PR completes the current `#23913` geometry delivery across parser/catalog metadata, runtime typing, frontend display, SQL-visible geometry behavior, SRID enforcement, and spatial index support.\n\n- add typed geometry DDL / metadata / protocol support for `POINT`, `GEOMETRY`, `LINESTRING`, `POLYGON`, `MULTIPOINT`, `MULTILINESTRING`, `MULTIPOLYGON`, and `GEOMETRYCOLLECTION`\n- extend SQL-visible geometry round-trip, measurement, relation, and validation behavior, including subtype checks, malformed payload rejection, finite-coordinate enforcement, SRID syntax / metadata / mismatch enforcement, and mixed-SRID runtime checks\n- wire `SPATIAL INDEX` creation / maintenance / planner paths so `SHOW CREATE TABLE`, `SHOW INDEX`, and indexed `EXPLAIN` paths work for validated predicates such as `ST_DISTANCE` and `ST_Contains`\n- sync `SHOW` / `information_schema` golden files to the delivered geometry metadata behavior\n\nValidation:\n- `make build`\n- `make ut`\n- direct MySQL replay of the issue `#23913` SQL matrix on `127.0.0.1:6001`, including typed DDL, requested `ST_*`, SRID success/mismatch, `SHOW CREATE TABLE`, `SHOW INDEX`, and indexed `EXPLAIN` for `ST_DISTANCE(... ) <= const` and `ST_Contains(indexed_geom, const_geom)`\n- `cd /Users/moukeyu/mo-tester && ./run.sh -n -g -p /Users/moukeyu/matrixone/test/distributed/cases/dml/show/show.test`\n  - `[SUMMARY] COST : 4s, TOTAL :189, SUCCESS : 189, FAILED :0, IGNORED :0, ABNORAML :0, SUCCESS RATE : 100%`\n- `cd /Users/moukeyu/mo-tester && ./run.sh -n -g -p /Users/moukeyu/matrixone/test/distributed/cases/zz_accesscontrol/account_restricted.sql`\n  - `[SUMMARY] COST : 5s, TOTAL :126, SUCCESS : 125, FAILED :0, IGNORED :1, ABNORAML :0, SUCCESS RATE : 100%`\n- local full-BVT follow-up still exposes unrelated local blockers outside this geometry change set (default-db harness drift, non-geometry DDL lock semantics, and an existing ISCP recovery panic around unfinished vector index jobs)\n",
